<span class="line" data-line="2"><span>   -&gt;  Seq Scan on orders o  (cost=0.00..155.00 rows=10000 width=8)</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="3"><span>   -&gt;  Memoize  (cost=0.30..0.32 rows=1 width=36)</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="4"><span>         Cache Key: o.user_id</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="5"><span>         Cache Mode: logical</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="6"><span>         Estimates: capacity=6 distinct keys=5 lookups=10000 hit percent=99.95%</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="7"><span>         -&gt;  Index Scan using users_pkey on users u  (cost=0.28..0.30 rows=1 width=36)</span></span>
